    "<sandbox>/work in argv is a fresh scratch folder mounted at /w holding the inputs as the command reads them (labs/LAB-8/ for seed 1 and the mutant, full/ for the n seeds); <repo> is this course repository, mounted read-only, whose bench/ folder is on PYTHONPATH.",
